Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing 接得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:17.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:18.23,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:19.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
